{"sourceUrl":"https://math.swu.edu.cn/info/1070/4663.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:27.948102+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://math.swu.edu.cn/info/1070/4663.htm","html":"<div>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>西南大学热忱欢迎全国优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免（初）试攻读我校硕士研究生！为做好接收</span><span>2027年优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免（初）试攻读研究生（以下简称推免生）工作，我院将开展接收推免生预报名工作，欢迎广大推免生报名！</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>一、</span></strong><strong><span>报名</span></strong><strong><span>条件</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>（一）拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></p>\n<p><span>（二）具有推免资格的本科培养单位推荐的、具有免（初）试攻读研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></p>\n<p><span>（三）研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力倾向。</span></p>\n<p><span>（四）诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录。</span></p>\n<p><span>（五）身心健康，符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>二、</span></strong><strong><span>报名</span></strong><strong><span>专业</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>我院在</span><span>“西南大学2027年接收推免生预报名系统”</span><span>（</span><span>http://swu.yjszsw.cn/tm/</span><span>）</span><span>可选报的</span><span>全日制硕士招生专业均可接收硕士推免生</span><span>；</span><span><span>最终以</span><span>“教育部推免服务系统”填报专业为准</span></span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>三、</span></strong><strong><span>报名和复试</span></strong><strong><span>程序</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>（</span></strong><strong><span>一</span></strong><strong><span>）</span></strong><strong><span>报名程序</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1、报名时间：</span><span>2026年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>8</span><span><span>日至</span><span>9月</span></span><span>13</span><span>日</span><span><span>（</span><span>1</span></span><span>2</span><span>:00前）。</span></p>\n<p><span>2、凡符合上述</span><span>报名</span><span><span>条件且有意愿报考我校的优秀应届本科毕业生（包括本校和外校），请于报名时间内登录</span><span>“西南大学</span></span><span>2027</span><span><span>年接收推免生预报名系统</span><span>”（http://swu.yjszsw.cn/tm/），</span></span><span>按要求上传相关材料</span><span>并</span><span>完成报名信息</span><span>提交</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>报名所需提交相关材料如下：</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>1）</span></span><span>本人</span><span>学生证、第二代身份证正反面</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>2）</span></span><span>本科阶段学习成绩单和专业排名证明，须加盖院系或教务部门公章</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）</span><span>大学英语四、六级考试成绩单或托福、雅思等英语水平的证明</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）</span><span>本人详细简历（包括本科专业背景、学习科研情况等）</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>5</span><span>）</span><span>其他各种学业能力证明材料（如</span><span>获奖证书、本人代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果等）</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span><span>要求：上传文件按照顺序扫描或合并成</span><span>1个pdf文件且大小不要超过8M。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>（</span></strong><strong><span>二</span></strong><strong><span>）</span></strong><strong><span>复试安排</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>学院</span><span>将对</span><span>考生</span><span>提交的所有材料进行审查</span><span>，择优确定</span><span>复试名单并发出通知，请考生及时关注</span><span>“西南大学</span><span>2027</span><span><span>年接收推免生预报名系统</span><span>”</span></span><span>站内消息并保持手机畅通。</span></p>\n<p><span>报到：</span><span>9月1</span><span>4</span><span>日</span><span>9</span><span>:</span><span>0</span><span>0-1</span><span>2</span><span>:</span><span>0</span><span>0，14:30-1</span><span>6</span><span>:</span><span>3</span><span>0, </span><span>具体</span><span>报到</span><span>时间</span><span>以</span><span>站内信</span><span>为准</span><span>。</span><span><span>考生凭个人身份证到</span><span>316会议室报到</span></span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span>面试</span><span><span>：</span><span>9月1</span></span><span>5</span><span>-</span><span>1</span><span>6</span><span>日</span><span>；</span></p>\n<p><span><span>复试形式和内容、时间和地点等具体安排以学院通知为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>四、其他事项</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>（一）</span><span>申请人提交的全部材料必须保证真实准确，若弄虚作假，一经发现，立即取消其接收推免申请资格</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>二</span><span>）</span><span>已在我校</span><span>“</span><span>西南大学</span><span>2027</span><span><span>年接收推免生预报名系统</span><span>”</span></span><span>预</span><span>报名的</span><span>考生</span><span>届时还</span><span>应</span><span><span>通过教育部</span><span>“全国推免服务系统”注册并填报志愿，</span></span><span>并在学院规定时间内</span><span>按工作程序完成招生流程</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>三</span><span>）</span><span><span>“全国推免服务系统”网址为：</span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/</span><span>，预计</span><span>9月下旬开放报名，请申请人关注中国研究生招生信息网和</span></span><span>学院官网</span><span>通知。</span></p>\n<p><span>（</span><span>四</span><span>）</span><span>我校将根据教育部</span><span>的</span><span>最新推免政策</span><span>和学校相关文件要求</span><span>及时公布</span><span>西南</span><span>大学</span><span>2027</span><span>年</span><span>接收推免生章程</span><span>及其他相关信息，</span><span>请</span><span>关注</span><span>西南大学研招网和学院官网</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>（五）</span><span>联系方式：</span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>联系人：姜老师 电话：023-68252976。</span></p>\n<p><span><br/></span><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>数学与统计学院</span></p>\n<p><span>2026年9月7日</span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>附件：</span><span>1．西南大学2027年接收推免生预报名系统操作步骤（考生端）</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"f36a89d733b78467130913b7e7af1976937602d63d038d6e4c253949fd33350a","textLength":1276,"sourceSha256":"8c59b07027951e6f1a9d54a13b5afdd25fd6200f3b9be927fb2a38d5605fa963","selector":".v_news_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1.西南大学2027年接收推免生预报名系统操作步骤（考生端）.docx","url":"https://math.swu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1912350497&wbfileid=70C9182219028C970A1217DC4B676D19"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-8d5b3981a791dccbd0ab","title":"2026年西南大学数学与统计学院关于接收2027年优秀应届本科毕业生推荐免（初）试攻读研究生的预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:27.948102+00:00"}
